BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Dialogue Dinner: What are the Promises & Responsibilities of Democ
 racy?
DTSTART:20260916T210000
DTEND:20260916T223000
DTSTAMP:20260913T151921Z
UID:578aba69ae1a05c4a753c3d12acde9@events-near-me
DESCRIPTION:Join the SPEECH Peer Educators for a dialogue dinner exploring
  the ideals\, challenges\, and responsibilities of democratic life. Togeth
 er\, participants will discuss who benefits from democracy\, who may be ex
 cluded from its promises\, what citizens owe one another\, and how democra
 tic institutions balance liberty\, justice\, pluralism\, and solidarity. H
 eld in recognition of America250\, this conversation invites students to r
 eflect on the nation's democratic experiment 250 years after its founding 
 and consider their own role in shaping its future. Dinner will be provided
 \, and all perspectives are welcome. Topic: What are the promises and resp
 onsibilities of democracy? Space is limited. Pre-registration on myHC requ
