SUMMARY:Pax Christi Meetings
DTSTART:20261001T230000
DTEND:20261002T000000
DTSTAMP:20260913T151921Z
UID:1a45584404874bbaee09cbe4a7f2ed@events-near-me
DESCRIPTION:Pax Christi\, a chapter of Pax Christi International\, meets w
 eekly in Campion House. All students are welcome. The group has a threefol
 d focus: to educate its members on issues of justice\, war and peace\; to 
 foster a strong sense of community among its members through prayer\, refl
 ection and discussion\; and to decide on specific actions to promote justi
